## Security hardening

- [X] Strip control characters (except newline) from content to prevent ESC/POS command injection ...
- [ ] ... and filter again on the Pi
- [ ] Rate limiting per user and per IP
- [ ] Only use middleware.RealIP behind a trusted reverse proxy (X-Forwarded-For is spoofable)
- [X] Public GET /messages/{id} leaks sender_ip to anyone with the UUID: use a slimmer public response type

